        <p>Revora is led by senior FMCG commercial practitioners &mdash; people who have run pricing, trade investment and category agendas for major suppliers in the New Zealand market. Every engagement is delivered by the people you meet on day one. No leverage model, no juniors learning on your budget.</p>
        <p>When a piece of work needs capability beyond our own &mdash; deep data engineering, specialist research &mdash; we bring in trusted partners and tell you exactly who's doing what. As the firm grows, we'll add named specialist partners in adjacent areas like marketing effectiveness and commercial finance. Watch this space.</p>
